# A 6 m riser at x = 40 facing +x: a lower floor (y = 0) on the +x side, an
# upper floor (y = 6) on the -x side. For gingerbread_ledge_runup_test.
o Ledge6m
v 40.0 0.0 -100.0
v 40.0 0.0 100.0
v 100.0 0.0 100.0
v 100.0 0.0 -100.0
v -100.0 6.0 -100.0
v -100.0 6.0 100.0
v 40.0 6.0 100.0
v 40.0 6.0 -100.0
f 1 2 3
f 1 3 4
f 5 6 7
f 5 7 8
f 1 8 7
f 1 7 2
